From: Flavius <Flavius256@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 21:47:04 +0000
Subject: functional c

Add functional C the port runs for unmatched functions.

Candidate C for functions with no matched C yet, listed in nonmatching/functional.tsv.
Three are adapted from the NTSC decomp (credited in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
nonmatching/game/func_0020E3D0.c declares the moby layout it reads itself:
src/game/mobyfunc.c, where it goes, uses include/moby.h, whose field names differ.
